---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Terminal">
  <div class="page-header">
    <p class="overline">Surfaces</p>
    <h1>Terminal</h1>
    <p class="desc">
      The depot CLI, the rover daemon, the fleet monitor — half of muni lives
      in the terminal. Berkeley Mono, box-drawing characters, and eight colors.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ HERO: Fleet TUI ════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <section>
    <div class="term-window">
      <div class="term-chrome">
        <div class="term-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <span class="term-win-title">muni-depot — fleet monitor</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="term-body hero-term">┌─ <span class="c-bold">MUNI DEPOT</span> ───────────────────── <span class="c-muted" id="hero-clock">14:32</span> ─┐
│                                              │
│  <span class="c-muted">FLEET         STATUS   BATT  TASK</span>           │
│  <span class="c-green">●</span> beaver-12   <span class="c-green">active</span>    73%  oak st nw      │
│  <span class="c-orange">◐</span> beaver-07   <span class="c-orange">yield</span>     45%  elm ave        │
│  <span class="c-blue">○</span> beaver-03   <span class="c-blue">charge</span>    12%  depot bay 2    │
│  <span class="c-muted">·</span> beaver-01   <span class="c-muted">off</span>       ──   maintenance    │
│                                              │
│  <span class="c-muted">CLEARED</span>  <span class="c-bold">2.4 km</span> <span class="c-green">▁▂▃▅▇█▇▅▃</span>  <span class="c-green">+12%</span>           │
│  <span class="c-muted">COVER</span>   <span class="c-orange">[████████████░░░░░░]</span> 67%            │
│                                              │
├─ <span class="c-muted">LOG</span> ────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  <span class="c-muted">14:32:07</span> <span class="c-blue">I</span> beaver-12 route.progress   67%   │
│  <span class="c-muted">14:31:52</span> <span class="c-orange">W</span> beaver-07 battery.low      45%   │
│  <span class="c-muted">14:31:40</span> <span class="c-blue">I</span> beaver-03 charge.update    12%   │
│  <span class="c-muted">14:31:33</span> <span class="c-red">E</span> beaver-01 can.timeout   vesc-3   │
│  <span class="c-muted">14:31:20</span> <span class="c-blue">I</span> beaver-12 yield.complete  4.2s   │
│                                              │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ <span id="spinner" class="c-green">⠋</span> <span class="c-green">nominal</span>  RTK 1.2cm  24ms  −4°C   <span class="c-muted">q ?</span> │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ 01 PALETTE ═════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Palette</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Eight colors mapped to ANSI slots. Orange is the ninth — the accent
        that makes muni muni. Every TUI element draws from this set.
      </p>
    </div>

    <pre class="term-body palette-block"><span class="c-swatch-black">██████</span>  black      <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.05  0      0)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-red">██████</span>  red        <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.637 0.237 25)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-green">██████</span>  green      <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.723 0.191 149)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-yellow">██████</span>  yellow     <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.85  0.18  85)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-blue">██████</span>  blue       <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.546 0.215 264)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-magenta">██████</span>  magenta    <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.68  0.22  300)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-cyan">██████</span>  cyan       <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.75  0.15  195)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-white">██████</span>  white      <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.90  0      0)</span>
<span class="c-swatch-orange">██████</span>  orange     <span class="c-muted">oklch(0.705 0.213 47.604)</span>    ← primary</pre>

    <div class="palette-roles">
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-green">●</span> Success / Active / Online</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-orange">●</span> Warning / Yielding / Accent</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-red">●</span> Error / Critical / E-stop</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-blue">●</span> Info / Charging / Neutral</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-cyan">●</span> Data / Coordinates / Links</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-magenta">●</span> Special / Debug / Trace</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-yellow">●</span> Highlight / Selection / Focus</div>
      <div class="role-chip"><span class="c-muted">●</span> Muted / Disabled / Timestamp</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ 02 BOX DRAWING ═════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-num">02</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Box Drawing</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Four panel primitives compose every TUI layout. Sharp corners for
        system chrome, rounded corners for content cards.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="box-grid">
      <div class="box-example">
        <span class="box-name">Panel</span>
        <pre class="term-body">┌─ Title ─────────┐
│                  │
│  Content here    │
│                  │
└──────────────────┘</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="box-example">
        <span class="box-name">Split Horizontal</span>
        <pre class="term-body">┌─────────┬────────┐
│         │        │
│  Left   │ Right  │
│         │        │
└─────────┴────────┘</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="box-example">
        <span class="box-name">Table</span>
        <pre class="term-body">┌──────┬────────┬──────┐
│ <span class="c-muted">HEAD</span> │ <span class="c-muted">HEAD</span>   │ <span class="c-muted">HEAD</span> │
├──────┼────────┼──────┤
│ data │ data   │ data │
│ data │ data   │ data │
└──────┴────────┴──────┘</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="box-example">
        <span class="box-name">Rounded</span>
        <pre class="term-body">╭─ Status ─────────╮
│                   │
│  <span class="c-green">●</span> All systems go  │
│                   │
╰───────────────────╯</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="box-example">
        <span class="box-name">Nested</span>
        <pre class="term-body">┌─ Outer ──────────────┐
│ ┌─ Inner A ────────┐ │
│ │  Content          │ │
│ └───────────────────┘ │
│ ┌─ Inner B ────────┐ │
│ │  Content          │ │
│ └───────────────────┘ │
└───────────────────────┘</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="box-example">
        <span class="box-name">Dividers</span>
        <pre class="term-body">┌─────────────────────┐
│  Section A          │
├─────────────────────┤
│  Section B          │
├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤
│  <span class="c-muted">Section C (soft)</span>    │
└─────────────────────┘</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ 03 STATUS & DATA ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-num">03</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Status &amp; Data</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Terminal-native data visualization. Progress bars, sparklines, gauges,
        and status indicators — all rendered with Unicode block characters.
      </p>
    </div>

    <pre class="term-body"><span class="c-muted">STATUS INDICATORS</span>

  <span class="c-green">●</span>  active        <span class="c-orange">◐</span>  yielding      <span class="c-blue">○</span>  charging      <span class="c-muted">·</span>  offline


<span class="c-muted">PROGRESS BARS</span>

  <span class="c-green">[████████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░]</span> 67%   route
  <span class="c-green">[██████████████████████████░░░░░░░░░]</span> 73%   battery
  <span class="c-orange">[████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░]</span> 33%   battery
  <span class="c-red">[████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░]</span> 12%   battery
  <span class="c-green">[███████████████████████████████████]</span> 100%  complete


<span class="c-muted">SPARKLINES</span>

  <span class="c-green">▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█▇▆▅▄▃▂▁</span>   cleared / hour
  <span class="c-blue">▅▃▂▁▂▃▅▇▅▃▂▁▂▃▅</span>   energy / hour
  <span class="c-orange">▃▃▄▅▇▇█▇▅▃▂▁▁▁▁</span>   interactions / hour


<span class="c-muted">GAUGES</span>

  CPU    <span class="c-red">████████████████████</span><span class="c-muted">░░</span>  89%
  MEM    <span class="c-green">██████████</span><span class="c-muted">░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>  42%
  DISK   <span class="c-green">███</span><span class="c-muted">░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>  12%
  NET    <span class="c-orange">██████████████</span><span class="c-muted">░░░░░░░░</span>  63%</pre>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ 04 LOG FORMAT ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-num">04</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Log Format</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Structured log output. Five levels, consistent column alignment,
        color-coded severity. Every daemon and CLI follows this format.
      </p>
    </div>

    <pre class="term-body"><span class="c-muted">TIMESTAMP    LVL  SOURCE      EVENT               DATA</span>

<span class="c-muted">14:32:09</span>     <span class="c-magenta">T</span>    beaver-12   wheel.encoder       fl:1847 fr:1852
<span class="c-muted">14:32:08</span>     <span class="c-muted">D</span>    beaver-12   can.frame           id:0x01 len:8
<span class="c-muted">14:32:07</span>     <span class="c-blue">I</span>    beaver-12   route.progress      67% eta:12m
<span class="c-muted">14:31:52</span>     <span class="c-orange">W</span>    beaver-07   battery.low         45% &lt; 50% threshold
<span class="c-muted">14:31:33</span>     <span class="c-red">E</span>    beaver-01   can.timeout         vesc-3 (retry 2/3)


<span class="c-muted">LEVELS</span>

  <span class="c-magenta">T</span>  trace     <span class="c-muted">Wire-level detail. Disabled in production.</span>
  <span class="c-muted">D</span>  debug     <span class="c-muted">Internal state. Enabled with RUST_LOG=debug.</span>
  <span class="c-blue">I</span>  info      Operational events. Always visible.
  <span class="c-orange">W</span>  warn      Degraded but functional. Investigate soon.
  <span class="c-red">E</span>  error     Failure. Immediate attention required.</pre>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ 05 CLI OUTPUT ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-num">05</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">CLI Output</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        The muni CLI is the primary deployment and management tool.
        Consistent output patterns across every subcommand.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cli-grid">
      <div class="cli-example">
        <span class="cli-name">Deploy</span>
        <pre class="term-body"><span class="c-muted">$</span> muni deploy rover frog-0 --all

  <span class="c-green">✓</span> Cross-compiled bvrd          <span class="c-muted">4.2s</span>
  <span class="c-green">✓</span> Uploaded to frog-0           <span class="c-muted">1.1s</span>
  <span class="c-green">✓</span> Config synced                <span class="c-muted">0.3s</span>
  <span class="c-green">✓</span> Service restarted            <span class="c-muted">0.8s</span>

  Deploy complete. frog-0 running <span class="c-bold">bvrd v0.8.2</span></pre>
