      <div class="cli-example">
        <span class="cli-name">GPS Monitor</span>
        <pre class="term-body"><span class="c-muted">$</span> muni gps monitor

  ┌─ GPS STATUS ───────────────────┐
  │ Mode:      <span class="c-green">RTK Fixed</span>           │
