<span class="c-bold">muni</span> <span class="c-cyan">depot</span> <span class="c-orange">❯</span>  <span class="c-muted">                   connected to depot</span>
<span class="c-bold">muni</span> <span class="c-cyan">frog-0</span> <span class="c-red">❯</span>  <span class="c-muted">                  e-stop active</span></pre>
  </section>

